    "detailed_description": "Storekeeper is a miniature story puzzle game with simple mechanics.<br>The plot will describe the period of life of a simple inhabitant of the darknet, the path of a long life.<br>The gameplay consists of emails that need to be delivered to the browser.<br>Managing one email is followed by others. There may be difficulties, the VPN will turn off and you will have to restart the level.<br>The game also has its own version of playboy, collect magazines on the levels in hard-to-reach places.<br>After completing all the levels, the ending will open.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2019630/extras/225b67cde369077a4e6e7547787265b1.webp?t=1665478208\" /></div><br><br>- hardcore puzzle<br>- cool soundtrack<br>- Atmospheric <br>- interesting stories to read",
